nate the variable $b$ from the system:\nUse an integer multiplier and leave the other equation unchanged.\n\nTo eliminate $b$, multiply the\n{{field-1}}\nequation by\n{{field-2}},\nand add the equations." :question/worked-solution "Notice that the coefficient of $b$ in the first equation is $-3$, while in the second equation it is $-15$.\n\nIf we multiply the first equation by ${\\color{blue}-5}$, then the coefficient of $b$ will turn into $15$, which will cancel with the coefficient of $-15$ in the second equation.\n\n$$\n\\{(a - 3b = -6)\\cdot (-5); -7a - 15b = 9\n$$\n\nNow, when we add the two equations, the variable $b$ will be eliminated:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n-5a + 15b &= 30 \\\\\n-7a - 15b &= 9 \\\\\n(-5a - 7a) &= (30 + 9) \\\\\n-12a &= 39\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is the following:\n\n> *To eliminate $b$, multiply the $\\bbox[3pt,Gainsboro]{\\color{blue}\\text{first}}$ equation by $\\bbox[3pt,Gainsboro]{\\color{blue}-5}$, and add the equations*."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186508321 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "33534e52-22a6-53b6-ab24-f2fc95901ef6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "18" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186508273} {:answer/id #uuid "7d632778-d7d0-5b8e-8054-b8393a63d67d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-18" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186508316} {:answer/id #uuid "bac5aab2-c0b2-503d-8b54-7be5dbbb5e27" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186508340} {:answer/id #uuid "f826503c-35ad-5dec-94b5-1a3ecf16f589" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186508372}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "bac5aab2-c0b2-503d-8b54-7be5dbbb5e27" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186508340} :answer-field/id #uuid "03b806d6-996d-59c5-bbcd-324cbd1e9495" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/se